@startuml
title Multilingual RAG Chatbot Sequence Diagram

actor Customer

participant Frontend
participant Backend
participant LanguageDetector
participant Translator
participant Retriever
database FAISS
participant Embedding
participant LLM

Customer -> Frontend : Ask Question
Frontend -> Backend : Send Question

Backend -> LanguageDetector : Detect Language
LanguageDetector --> Backend : Language

alt Vietnamese

    Backend -> Translator : Translate Question to English
    Translator --> Backend : English Question
end
    Backend -> Retriever : Retrieve Context

    Retriever -> Embedding : Generate Embedding
    Embedding --> Retriever : Query Vector

    Retriever -> FAISS : Similarity Search
    FAISS --> Retriever : Top-K Documents

    Retriever --> Backend : Retrieved Context

alt Vietnamese
    Backend -> LLM : Original Question + Context
    LLM --> Backend : Answer (Vietnamese)

else English

    Backend -> LLM : Question + Context
    LLM --> Backend : Answer (English)

end

Backend --> Frontend : Final Answer
Frontend --> Customer : Display Answer

@enduml